<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41692" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί-χῠσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ʽἐπιχέὠ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pouring upon</i> or <i>in,
				influx,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				77d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				356a6
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμῶν ἐπιχύσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					8.331d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ὄμβρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					41.45
				</span></i>
			 : metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πολιτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					740e
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς τῶν ἡδονῶν ῥώμης</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				841a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόχυσις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
			</span></i><i>in de An.</i><i><span class="en">
				291.32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κονίασις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>toast,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				16.21.12
			</span></i> (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχύσεις τινὸς λαμβάνειν,
				ποιεῖσθαι</span> (cf.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχέω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Demetr.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Brut.</u>
				24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>anointing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ταῖς ἐπιχύσεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(1).155.121
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Rhodes</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>beaker</i> or <i>wine-jug,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Men.
				503
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phylarch.
				44J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plaut.
				<u>Rud.</u>
				1319
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τοῦ χαλκίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					214
				</span></i>
			.</div>
